use firn/tags

ast-grep is a Module
ast-grep is tagged cli-tools

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.ast-grep.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.ast-grep]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."ast-grep"."enable": enable "ast-grep structural code search"
